@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

# ==========================================================
# TOKENS - প্রতিটা লগিন করার পর নিচের ভ্যারিয়েবলে বসিয়ে নাও
# ==========================================================
@adminToken = PASTE_RAHIM_TOKEN_HERE
@memberToken = PASTE_KARIM_TOKEN_HERE
@outsiderToken = PASTE_SALIM_TOKEN_HERE

# ==========================================================
# SECTION 0: SETUP - 3 জন ইউজার রেজিস্টার/লগিন
# Rahim  -> Group Admin (creator)
# Karim  -> Group Member (later added by Rahim)
# Salim  -> Outsider (কোনো group-এর member না)
# ==========================================================

### Register Rahim (হবে Group Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "rahim",
    "email": "rahim@gmail.com",
    "first_name": "Rahim",
    "last_name": "Uddin",
    "password": "admin123@",
    "password2": "admin123@"
}

### Register Karim (হবে Group Member)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "karim",
    "email": "karim@gmail.com",
    "first_name": "Karim",
    "last_name": "Hossain",
    "password": "admin123@",
    "password2": "admin123@"
}

### Register Salim (Outsider - কোনো group-এ থাকবে না)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "salim",
    "email": "salim@gmail.com",
    "first_name": "Salim",
    "last_name": "Ahmed",
    "password": "admin123@",
    "password2": "admin123@"
}

### Login Rahim -> token copy করে @adminToken এ বসাও
POST {{baseUrl}}/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "rahim@gmail.com",
    "password": "admin123@"
}

### Login Karim -> token copy করে @memberToken এ বসাও
POST {{baseUrl}}/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "karim@gmail.com",
    "password": "admin123@"
}

### Login Salim -> token copy করে @outsiderToken এ বসাও
POST {{baseUrl}}/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "salim@gmail.com",
    "password": "admin123@"
}


# ==========================================================
# SECTION 1: GROUP CRUD
# ==========================================================

### [PASS] Rahim creates a group -> সে-ই admin/creator হবে
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
    "name": "Jaflong Tour"
}

### [PASS] Rahim lists groups -> শুধু নিজের group(গুলো) দেখবে (get_queryset filter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [EXPECTED: EMPTY or 403 depending on queryset] Salim lists groups -> কোনো group নেই তার
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/
Authorization: Bearer {{outsiderToken}}

### [PASS] Rahim retrieves his group detail (group id মিলিয়ে নাও)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [PASS - 200] Rahim (admin/creator) updates group name
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
    "name": "Jaflong Tour - Updated"
}

### [FAIL - 403 expected] Karim (not yet a member) tries to update group
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

{
    "name": "Hacked Name"
}

### [FAIL - 403 expected] Salim (outsider) tries to delete group
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{outsiderToken}}


# ==========================================================
# SECTION 2: MEMBERSHIP - ADD/REMOVE
# ==========================================================

### [PASS - 201] Rahim (admin) adds Karim as a member
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/members/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
    "username": "karim"
}

### [FAIL - 400 expected] Rahim tries adding Karim again -> duplicate membership
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/members/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
    "username": "karim"
}

### [FAIL - 403 expected] Karim (normal member, not admin) tries to add Salim
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/members/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

{
    "username": "salim"
}

### [FAIL - 403 expected] Salim (outsider, not even member) tries to add himself
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/members/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{outsiderToken}}

{
    "username": "salim"
}

### [FAIL - 403 expected] Karim (not admin) tries removing a member (membership id মিলিয়ে নাও)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/members/2/
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### [PASS - 204] Rahim (admin) removes Karim from group (test-এর শেষে, বাকি টেস্টের আগে না)
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/members/2/
# Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
# ^ এই টেস্টটা শেষে চালাবে, কারণ পরের Expense টেস্টে Karim-কে member থাকতে হবে


# ==========================================================
# SECTION 3: EXPENSE - CREATE / LIST
# ==========================================================

### [PASS - 201] Rahim (admin, also a member) creates an expense -> paid_by auto = Rahim
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
    "amount": "3000.00",
    "description": "Lunch",
    "spliter_list": [2, 3]
}

### [PASS - 201] Karim (member) creates an expense -> paid_by auto = Karim
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

{
    "amount": "1500.00",
    "description": "Boat ride"
}

### [FAIL - 403 expected] Salim (outsider) tries to create expense
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{outsiderToken}}

{
    "amount": "500.00",
    "description": "Snacks"
}

### [PASS - 200] Rahim (member) lists expenses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [PASS - 200] Karim (member) lists expenses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### [FAIL - 403 expected] Salim (outsider) tries to list expenses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/
Authorization: Bearer {{outsiderToken}}

### [PASS - 200] Any member retrieves a single expense detail (expense id মিলিয়ে নাও)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}


# ==========================================================
# SECTION 4: EXPENSE - UPDATE / DELETE (আসল permission টেস্ট)
# ধরে নিচ্ছি: expense id=1 -> Rahim-এর (paid_by=Rahim)
#             expense id=2 -> Karim-এর (paid_by=Karim)
# ==========================================================

### [PASS - 200] Owner (Rahim) updates his own expense (id=1)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
    "amount": "3500.00",
    "description": "Lunch - updated"
}

### [PASS - 200] Owner (Karim) updates his own expense (id=2)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/2/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

{
    "amount": "1800.00",
    "description": "Boat ride - updated"
}

### [FAIL - 403 expected] Karim tries to update Rahim's expense (id=1) -> not owner, not admin
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

{
    "amount": "9999.00",
    "description": "Tampered"
}

### [PASS - 200] Admin (Rahim) updates Karim's expense (id=2) -> admin override works
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/2/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
    "amount": "2000.00",
    "description": "Boat ride - admin corrected"
}

### [FAIL - 403 expected] Salim (outsider) tries to update any expense
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{outsiderToken}}

{
    "amount": "1.00",
    "description": "Hacked"
}

### [FAIL - 403 expected] Karim tries to delete Rahim's expense (id=1)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### [PASS - 204] Karim deletes his own expense (id=2)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/2/
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### [PASS - 204] Admin (Rahim) deletes his own expense (id=1)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [FAIL - 403 or 404 expected] Salim tries to delete any expense
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{outsiderToken}}


# ==========================================================
# SECTION 5: TAMPERING CHECK - paid_by spoof করার চেষ্টা
# ==========================================================

### [SECURITY CHECK] Karim চেষ্টা করছে paid_by=Rahim (id=1) পাঠিয়ে expense create করতে
# Expected: paid_by ignore হয়ে serializer.save(paid_by=request.user) থেকে Karim-ই বসবে
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/groups/1/expenses/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

{
    "paid_by": 1,
    "amount": "100.00",
    "description": "Spoof attempt - should still show Karim as paid_by"
}
